# 00_ARCHITECTURE

Repo-wide architecture rule tests live here.

## Goals
- Keep repo shape and cross-project conventions testable.
- Add rule files in numbered order: `tests/00_*_test.go`, `tests/01_*_test.go`, `tests/02_*_test.go`, ...
- Use standard `testing` package first. Keep deps light.

## Run
```bash
cd 00_ARCHITECTURE
go test ./...
```

## Layout
- `internal/testutil`: shared helpers for locating repo root and asserting files/dirs.
- `tests`: numbered rule files.

## Rule file convention
- `00_*`: repo-wide smoke/layout rules.
- `01_*`: server rules.
- `02_*`: CLI rules.
- `03_*`: mobile rules.
- Keep one concern per file when possible.
